false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"下列何種抗菌劑不能抑制細菌DNA合成？","opts":["nalidixic acid","trimethoprim","ciprofloxacin","polymyxin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"下列何者是細菌對glycopeptides類抗生素產生抗藥性的可能原因？","opts":["DNA-dependent RNA polymerase產生突變","細胞壁合成前驅物質（precursors）產生改變","PBPs產生突變","β-lactamase產生"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"下列微生物中，何者最常導致院內感染？","opts":["Candida albicans","Lactobacillus casei","Propionibacterium acnes","Bifidobacterium dentium"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"有關細菌分型的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["包含表現型分型法（phenotyping）及基因型分型法（genotyping）","抗生素敏感性分型，若其差異兩種或兩種以上者，判斷為不同型","經由生化鑑定為同一種species的細菌，進一步利用基因型分型法也可能區別為不同型","脈衝式電泳分析（pulsed-field gel electrophoresis, PFGE）不適用於細菌分型"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"E-test是一種含有梯度濃度的抗生素紙條（strip），其優點是：","opts":["較傳統紙錠擴散法成本低廉，且細菌培養時間可大幅縮短","可以測定出抗生素的MBC（minimal bactericidal concentration）","可以測定出抗生素的MIC（minimal inhibitory concentration）","在90 mm的培養基上同時使用多條E-test strips"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"下列關於quinolones類抗生素之敘述，何者正確？","opts":["是folinic acid的衍生物","會與細菌之DNA gyrase結合","會與DNA-dependent RNA polymerase結合","只對厭氧菌有效"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"抗黴菌藥物flucytosine，其作用機轉主要是抑制下列何種物質之合成？","opts":["DNA及RNA","細胞壁","細胞膜","紡綞絲"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"下列那些項目是CLSI規定檢測MRSA抗生素感受性之標準條件？①以菌落直接稀釋法來製備接種原 ②培養溫度不超過35℃ ③培養24小時後才判讀 ④測定MIC時培養基中應含2% NaCl","opts":["僅①③④","僅②③④","僅①②③","①②③④"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"下列何種方法是結核桿菌藥敏試驗之gold standard？","opts":["resistance ratio method","absolute concentration method","proportion method","radiometric method"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"關於酵母菌之試管稀釋法抗生素感受性試驗之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["培養液使用RPMI 1640","適用於測試Candida spp.與Cryptococcus neoformans","接種後於35℃培養18～24小時觀察","接種量一般為5.0×102至2.5×103CFU/mL"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"泌尿生殖道拭子（urogenital swab），若以棉花為材料，應以下列何種方式處理以吸收其毒性，才不致影響致病菌的分離？","opts":["H O2 2","charcoal","alcohol","phenol"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"尿道分泌物的Gram stain鏡檢，若發現有革蘭氏陰性intracellular diplococci，尤其是男性，通常表示感染了下列何菌？","opts":["Chlamydia trachomatis","Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Haemophilus ducreyi","Treponema pallidum"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"黴菌雙形性（dimorphism）之意義為何？","opts":["Sabouraud dextrose agar產生孢子，在brain heart infusion培養基產生菌絲","37℃以上培養產生無性孢子，25℃以下形成有性孢子","在25℃為菌絲狀菌形態，在37℃則為酵母菌形態","大孢子及小孢子之比率隨CO 濃度而改變2"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"下列何種黴菌的感染可在組織找到sclerotic bodies？","opts":["Phialophora verrucosa","Trichophyton rubrum","Candida albicans","Rhizopus spp."],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"下圖為全身性黴菌感染症致病菌，在人體中會以小的（2～5μm）酵母菌型藏身於單核球內，則此黴菌為：","opts":["粗球孢子菌（Coccidioides immitis）","巴西副球黴菌（Paracoccidioides brasiliensis）","莢膜組織漿菌（Histoplasma capsulatum）","皮炎芽生黴菌（Blastomyces dermatitidis）"],"fig":true,"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"下列何種抗黴菌的機制是抑制cytochrome P450酵素系統？","opts":["azole","polyene","allylamine","flucytosine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"黴菌與細菌的不同處，在於黴菌細胞壁由下列何種物質所構成？","opts":["phospholipid bilayer","chitin","peptidoglycan","teichoic acid"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"Microsporum（小孢子菌）是屬於：","opts":["不完全菌門（Deuteromycota）","接合菌門（Zygomycota）","子囊菌門（Ascomycota）","擔子菌門（Basidiomycota）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"如下圖，從皮癬菌病人刮下之皮屑，經培養後進行顯微鏡檢查，可觀察到單個或多個棍棒狀（club-shape）的大分生孢子（macroconidia），而無觀察到小分生孢子（microconidia），最可能為下列何者？","opts":["Epidermophyton spp.","Microsporum spp.","Trichophyton spp.","Acremonium spp."],"fig":true,"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"黴菌的菌絲具有分隔，即可排除下列何種黴菌的可能性？","opts":["dermatophytes","zygomycetes","dimorphic molds","dematiaceous hyphae"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"Malassezia furfur生長時需要脂肪酸，故常加下列何種成分於培養基表面？","opts":["亞麻仁油","花生油","橄欖油","沙拉油"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列何種細菌可能與腫瘤形成有關？","opts":["Streptococcus agalactiae","Staphylococcus saprophyticus","Streptococcus bovis","Staphylococcus epidermidis"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"下列何者通常不是生物恐怖戰劑的致病微生物？","opts":["Francisella tularensis","Bacillus anthracis","Yersinia pestis","Salmonella Typhi"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"有關細菌與其適當之選擇性培養基配對，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["Gardnerella vaginalis－human blood bilayer Tween agar","Aeromonas spp.－thiosulfate citrate-bile salts sucrose agar","E. coli O157:H7－MacConkey sorbitol agar","Legionella spp.－buffered charcoal-yeast extract agar"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"有關疾病與病原菌配對，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["chancre－Treponema pallidum","chancroid－Haemophilus ducreyi","rheumatic fever－Staphylococcus aureus","pseudomembranous colitis－Clostridium difficile"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"下列何種疾病不是spirochetes所引起？","opts":["梅毒（syphilis）","萊姆氏病（Lyme disease）","淋病（gonorrhea）","回歸熱（relapsing fever）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"下列何者不是Listeria monocytogenes的特徵？","opts":["具listeriolysin","低溫具motility","具nitrate reduction反應","具水解esculin能力"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"下列何種細菌為最常見之院內感染菌？","opts":["Acinetobacter baumannii","Streptococcus pyogenes","Campylobacter jejuni","Haemophilus influenzae"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"在野外被植物刺入皮膚，在傷口處形成癤瘤狀硬塊，之後經由淋巴管擴散至其他組織。自患者潰瘍處取得biopsy，染色看到許多長條型酵母細胞呈雪茄狀（cigar form）。於室溫培養3至5天，鏡檢時菌絲之側邊或頂端有排列成小花狀的圓形孢子，其感染原為何？","opts":["Exophiala jeanselmei","Sporothrix schenckii","Cladophialophora carrionii","Blastomyces dermatitidis"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}]}